[
    {
        "content": "<p>I was wondering if there is (planned) support for a way to define an inductive predicate and its notation at the same time as it is done in Rocq with <code>where</code> clauses, e.g.:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Coq\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">Inductive</span> <span class=\"n\">and</span> <span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"kt\">Prop</span> <span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n  <span class=\"n\">conj</span> <span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">B</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"o\">/\\</span> <span class=\"n\">B</span>\n<span class=\"n\">where</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"A /\\ B\"</span> <span class=\"o\">:=</span> <span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">).</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>For long definitions with many constructors (like the type of derivations of a proof or rewriting system), I find that it quite improves readability and makes the definition closer to its paper version.</p>",
        "id": 583280343,
        "sender_full_name": "Pablo Donato",
        "timestamp": 1775139818
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You can do this by disabling hygiene:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hygiene</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">infix</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" ∧∧ \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>or safer</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">section</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hygiene</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">infix</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" ∧∧ \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">infix</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" ∧∧ \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 583312025,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1775148780
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Something that could be nice is if you could put notation commands into a <code>mutual</code> block, like so:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">infix</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" ∧∧ \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>A problem with this is that <code>mutual</code> blocks are parsed all at once, so a naive approach wouldn't work (the syntax won't exist when the <code>inductive</code> is parsed). Possibly the <code>infix</code> command could somehow work with the parser itself and add notation while it's parsing...</p>\n<p>Or there could be something like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">declare_infix</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" ∧∧ \"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"n\">notation_rule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyAnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 583331557,
        "sender_full_name": "Kyle Miller",
        "timestamp": 1775155554
    }
]